  (text "Input filter: 10 ohm in each sense wire, with 10 nF between them.\nBoth Kelvin traces return directly to the shunt sense terminals.\nThe VBUS input measures voltage after reverse-polarity protection and before the eFuse."
    (at 30.48 172.72 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "ceaac199-c42c-441c-86c3-45eb659aa020"))
  (text "Address 0x41 (A1=GND, A0=AUX). ADCRANGE=0 starting range: +/-163.84mV.\nAUX can disappear without enabling or disabling power protection.\nCurrent is electrical evidence, not proof of valve movement. Die temperature is not pack temperature.\nCharging current takes a separate upstream service path and is not measured here."
    (at 30.48 208.28 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "62f72be6-e986-406d-a33d-d9c046bc7cb3"))
