  (text "Measures propulsion voltage and discharge current. The two shunt sense wires come from f02a;\nsmall resistors and a capacitor filter noise before the INA228. Readings return to Croi over f03 I2C.\nThis records electrical current. It cannot prove that a valve physically moved."
